df6aba032ec1cab103c5028d38d36e316330","rendered_turn_sha256":"3ae0549b4a037d2cc7f3b387de0c13b3248bd962659b9ff1d5c503cadc2a37e1","session_date":"2023-05-03","session_datetime":"2023-05-03T13:16:00","session_id":"session_5","session_index":5,"source_sha256":"ab7647c373b7d229889b2cd7bb225ee9148823658a395d02fc21c85f7b8558a4","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":6}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Hey Calvin! Long time no talk. How's it going? Crazy news - I'm teaming up with a local garage. Take a look at what we working on together!\n[Image caption: a photo of a car being worked on in a garage]\n[S5T1] (dia_id: D5:1)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave, great to hear from you! That's awesome news about teaming up with a local garage. Super inspiring seeing you follow your passion. Congratulations on this new venture. It's impressive how far you've come since we last chatted. How's everything going?\n[Image caption: a photo of a green car in a garage with a sign in the background]\n[S5T2] (dia_id: D5:2)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! I'm loving this job. I get to work with awesome mechanics and share my knowledge about cars. Here's what I'm currently working on! It's a cool project, even if it's a bit challenging. 🤩\n[Image caption: a photography of a man working on a car engine in a garage]\n[S5T3] (dia_id: D5:3)\n\nCalvin: That car looks awesome! You're putting in a lot of effort and it's great to see the end result. Keep up the good work. Got any plans for what's next?\n[S5T4] (dia_id: D5:4)\n\nDave: Thanks Calvin! Appreciate the support. I'm gonna keep learning more about auto engineering, maybe even build a custom car from scratch someday - that's the dream! For now, just gonna keep working on this project and assisting customers.\n[S5T5] (dia_id: D5:5)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! You're so inspiring - good for you for pushing yourself to achieve your dream. Making a custom car sounds awesome. D